description:
solana video editor is a local-first Android video editor designed for Solana Mobile devices and compatible Android phones.

The App lets users:

- import videos from device storage;
- trim clips;
- apply grayscale and transform-based edits;
- change resolution, scale, and rotation;
- preview and export edited videos on-device; and
- connect a compatible Solana wallet through Mobile Wallet Adapter ("MWA") for wallet-gated access and optional on-chain tipping.

